      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3268&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>Stereotype to mark attributes, methods or associations to exist only on the&amp;nbsp;server side of a sdo (service data object) model. However method which are on the serverside only have a client proxy to synchronize the client and server model and invoke the method.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
